---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="First Contact Thailand | Trusted Local Connections"
  description="First Contact Thailand connects locals, expats and visitors with trusted services and reliable local businesses."
  image="/assets/fct/hero6-1024x542.jpg"
>
  <h1 class="visually-hidden">First Contact Thailand</h1>

  <section class="home-reference">
    <div class="home-reference__inner">
      <div class="home-reference__rotator" role="img" aria-label="Scenes from Thailand">
        <span class="home-reference__slide home-reference__slide--beach"></span>
        <span class="home-reference__slide home-reference__slide--bangkok"></span>
        <span class="home-reference__slide home-reference__slide--temple"></span>
        <span class="home-reference__slide home-reference__slide--island"></span>
        <span class="home-reference__slide home-reference__slide--samui"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="home-reference__copy">
        <h2>About Us</h2>
        <p>First Contact was founded in Koh Samui in 2024 with a clear purpose: to bring locals, expats, and travellers together by connecting them with trusted services and reliable local businesses.</p>
        <p>Supporting local charities, Rotary clubs, and community groups across Thailand is a major focus for First Contact and remains at the heart of everything we do.</p>
        <p>Our collective network began with more than 500 businesses in Koh Samui and has since expanded on a large scale across Thailand.</p>

        <h2>How It Works</h2>
        <p>Membership with First Contact is free. Our members give back by donating a percentage of the revenue they generate through First Contact to charitable and community causes.</p>
        <p>We can direct you to reliable providers across a wide range of sectors, including marketing and advertising, legal services, tours and entertainment, food and beverage deals, vehicle hire, accommodation, property development and management, and many more.</p>
        <p>First Contact helps people find the right services while supporting the local communities we all care about.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
